<Explanation language="ENGLISH">"Rhinox Flerders are those rare Ogres who manage to keep an eye ontomorrow even as they fill their gut today. Most Ogres, in possession husbandry and care, as well as fighting off other Ogres who wander t0o close to the animal pens or grazing areas looking for a meal. They trade in fine Rhinox Bulls for breeding, and are always on the lookout. Precious few Rhinox Herders make it to the Empire, and those who In the Mountains of Mourn their talents make Rhinox Herders as a mercenary, but others do manage to find work caring for lesser essential, as the beasts they keep are used for labour and warfare, beasts. Still, all long for the creatures they formerly raised, both for a as well as for food. It is a coveted position, and one only granted _ taste of home and for the respect their former position brought them. to Ogres who prove themselves capable of capturing, breeding and Those who do manage to maintain a Rhinox or two in the low lands maintaing the beasts, as well as keeping their own apatites in check. of the Empire are respected by their own kind, widely sought after as heavy cavalary, and rarely sleep well in the company of other Ogres."</Explanation>
